   $q$A student says, "People can help sea turtles survive." Which pair of details best supports this?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Towns turn off outdoor lights, and volunteers put fences around nests.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Hatchlings head toward light, and buildings have bright lights.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"The mother digs with her back flippers, and she covers the eggs.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"supports-different-claim"},{"text":"The eggs hatch in two months, and the babies dig out at night.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"supports-different-claim"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Towns turn off outdoor lights, and volunteers put fences around nests.$q$, $q$Turning off lights and fencing nests are things people do to protect turtles, as paragraph 4 explains. The details about light alone show a danger but not how people help.$q$, 'draft', 'aa38fc50-7a12-59c6-9a5d-aa9b1a234f2d')
