insert into public.passages (id, code, skill_id, sat_alignment, grade_band, title, body, status)
values ('44009444-1d98-5e64-b435-1aa250a224d3', 'rg4-evidence-inference-p07', (select id from public.skills where slug = 'read-g4-evidence-inference'), null,
        '3-5', $q$The Library on Wheels$q$, $q$In the town of Millbrook, the library is far from many homes. Some families do not have a car, and the bus does not stop near every street. So the library sends books out on a big blue truck called the bookmobile.

The bookmobile has shelves along both walls. It holds about two thousand books, plus some audiobooks and puzzles. Every Tuesday it parks at the senior center. On Thursdays it visits two apartment buildings. On Saturdays it stops at the park near the ball fields.

Mr. Delgado drives the bookmobile and helps visitors find books. He keeps a notebook of requests. If someone asks for a book that is not on the truck, he brings it from the main library the next week.

Last summer, the bookmobile added a new stop at the town pool. Children could return their books, pick out new ones, and then go swimming. The number of children who read over the summer went up that year. The library now plans to add a second truck.$q$, 'draft')
on conflict (id) do update set title = excluded.title, body = excluded.body
